# Blitz — Feature architecture

Canonical detail: `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/CV_HTML_PDF.md`, `DASHBOARD.md`.

## Feature index

| Feature | UI / entry | Background / content | Storage / data |
|--------|------------|----------------------|----------------|
| Popup (420px) | `popup/dist/index.html`, `App.jsx` | Same messages as dashboard | `chrome.storage.local` |
| Full workspace | `popup/dist/dashboard.html`, `web/` (`npm run web:dev`) | `onMessage` + `onMessageExternal` (localhost) | Same storage; IDB history **extension origins only** |
| Site shell | `SiteShell.jsx`, `fullPage` prop, `site-views.js` | — | — |
| On-page widget | Shadow DOM `content/job-widget.js` + CSS | `OPEN_BLITZ`, `WIDGET_GENERATE`, `BLITZ_PAGE_STATE` | `pending_job` via widget generate |
| Page context | `content/page-context.js` → `window.blitzPageContext` | Used by widget + `GET_TAB_JOB_INFO` | — |
| Open job tabs | `WorkspaceTabJobs.jsx` (Home + Queue, `fullPage` only) | `LIST_JOB_TABS`, `ADD_TABS_TO_QUEUE` in `background/tab-jobs.js` | `job_queue` items may include `jobData`, `sourceTabId` |
| Bulk URL queue | `JobQueue.jsx` | `ADD_QUEUE_URLS`, `PROCESS_QUEUE`, `queue-processor.js` | `job_queue`, `queue_processing` |
| CV HTML → PDF | `CvTemplateEditor.jsx`, Review download | `GENERATE_PDF` → offscreen `html2canvas` + jsPDF | `cv_html_template` |
| AI generation | Dashboard / Review / widget | `GENERATE_APPLICATION`, `WIDGET_GENERATE` | `pending_application`, `pending_job` |
| Application history | `ApplicationHistory.jsx`, `ExistingApplicationNotice.jsx` | `persistGeneratedApplication` on generate (SW + queue); `LOAD_HISTORY_APPLICATION` | IndexedDB by `listingKey`; events (`generated`, `form_filled`, …) |
| Application naming | History / Review labels | `formatApplicationTitle` in prompts | IndexedDB + `applicationTitle` on records |
| Web ↔ extension bridge | `WebConnect.jsx`, `extension-env.js` | `sendExtensionMessage()` → extension ID | `localStorage` key `blitz_extension_id` |

## Layer invariants

- **AI**: only `background/service-worker.js` (+ imports from `popup/src/lib/ai.js`, `prompts.js`).
- **Job page DOM**: only `content/*`; fill gated on `FILL_FORM`.
- **PDF render**: only `offscreen/`; `GENERATE_PDF_OFFSCREEN` not handled in SW (`return false`).
- **Dashboard messaging**: use `sendExtensionMessage` from `lib/extension-env.js` on localhost web; `chrome.runtime.sendMessage` on extension pages.

## Key background messages

`JOB_DETECTED`, `GENERATE_APPLICATION`, `FILL_FORM`, `GENERATE_PDF`, `PROCESS_QUEUE`, `LIST_JOB_TABS`, `ADD_TABS_TO_QUEUE`, `ADD_QUEUE_URLS`, `WIDGET_GENERATE`, `OPEN_BLITZ`, `SCRAPE_ACTIVE_TAB`, `ESTIMATE_GENERATION_COST`, `LOAD_HISTORY_APPLICATION`, license/API test handlers.

## Tab queue flow

1. `listOpenJobTabs()` queries tabs → `GET_TAB_JOB_INFO` per tab (context + scrape).
2. UI shows Ready / Select job / Reload; user selects → `ADD_TABS_TO_QUEUE`.
3. `processQueue` prefers `sourceTabId` if still open; else opens background tab; does not close user tabs.

## CV PDF flow

1. AI returns `cvDocument` JSON → `cv-document.js` / `cv-html.js` enrich HTML fields.
2. `cv-template-engine.js` renders template (`{{{triple}}}` = raw HTML, `{{double}}` = escaped).
3. Offscreen renders HTML → canvas → PDF (`copy-offscreen-deps.mjs` vendors html2canvas + jsPDF).

## Content script load (job sites)

`page-context.js` before platform scripts; `detector.js` last. Widget: `job-widget.js` + `web_accessible_resources` for CSS.
